    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The national motto 'Satyameva Jayate' is taken from the Mundaka Upanishad.",
        "The Gayatri Mantra is found in the 3rd Mandala of the Rigveda and is addressed to the solar deity Savitr.",
        "Iron was referred to as 'Krishna Ayas' or 'Shyama Ayas' during the Later Vedic Period.",
        "Indra is the most prominent deity in the Rigveda, with 250 dedicated hymns."
      ],
